  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**<br></span></span></b></p></div></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\"  coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\"  filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\t\t<v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\t\t<v:formulas>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\t\t</v:formulas>\t\t<v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\t\t<o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\t</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"_x329546256\" style=\"v-text-anchor:top;mso-position-vertical-relative:page;mso-position-vertical:absolute;margin-top:11.97pt;mso-position-horizontal-relative:page;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;margin-left:30.57pt;width:368.31pt;height:328.85pt;position:absolute;\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"><v:imagedata o:title=\"DRW000021c831ff\" src=\"file:///C:\\Users\\user\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\DRW000021c831ff.gif\"/></v:shape><![endif]-->  <!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"368\" height=\"328\" alt=\"묶음 개체입니다.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" v:shapes=\"_x329546256\"><!--[endif]-->  </p><p>투명지를 OHP용지로 인쇄하여 오려서 활핀으로 달시각에&nbsp;끼워서 자전시키면서&nbsp; 관찰합니다.</p><p>학생들이 이해하는데 도움이 되더라구요.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1099%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20180707151805&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile283.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F995C2C3C5B405975239AA9')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 3-1-7 달을 볼수 있는 시간.ppt</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1099%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20180707151805&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile277.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F998B583C5B40597B016994')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 활동지7-1투명지 지평선(까맣게).hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1099%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20180707151805&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile262.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9999633C5B40597F3D7782')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 활동지7-달시각 투명과 사이즈맞춤.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1099%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20180707151805&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile271.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99043B3C5B405983294ABC')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 활동지7-달의 위상 변화 -개인활동지.hwp</a></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
